{
  "uid": "incident-resolution",
  "title": "Resolução de Incidentes — Observabilidade",
  "tags": ["observability", "demo", "lgtm"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 5,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Visão do serviço (RED)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/servico-red/servico-red",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "tooltip": "Dashboard de operação do dia a dia",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "asDropdown": false,
      "tags": []
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "Erros no payment",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "expr": "{service_name=\"payment\"} | severity_text=\"ERROR\" | scenario=~\"${scenario:pipe}\"",
        "tagKeys": "scenario",
        "titleFormat": "Erro no payment"
      },
      {
        "name": "Lentidão no gateway",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "yellow",
        "expr": "{service_name=\"payment\"} | severity_text=\"WARN\" | scenario=~\"${scenario:pipe}\"",
        "tagKeys": "scenario",
        "titleFormat": "Gateway lento"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "scenario",
        "label": "Filtrar Cenário",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "fast,io,db,cpu",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": ["All"],
          "value": ["$__all"]
        },
        "options": [
          { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "fast", "value": "fast" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "io", "value": "io" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "db", "value": "db" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "cpu", "value": "cpu" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Roteiro e comandos da demonstração",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Roteiro",
          "gridPos": { "h": 16, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "### Roteiro\n1. **Sintoma** — RED saudável: só `fast`, cerca de 1 req/s, erro em 0%.\n2. **Dispare** um cenário. Em ~5s os números do topo mudam.\n3. **Isolamento** — filtre o cenário e clique num losango ◆ ou num Trace ID.\n4. **Causa** — leia o log do mesmo trace e o flamegraph.\n5. **Fechamento** — ligue o gerador com erro para o gráfico ficar vermelho, e volte ao `fast` no fim.\n\nOs comandos do Docker rodam na pasta do projeto. Cada chamada imprime a resposta no terminal.\n\n| Cenário | O que simula | 10 requisições (PowerShell) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🟡 **io** | Gateway lento (1.5–3s), HTTP 200 | `(1..10).ForEach({ curl.exe -s -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=io\"; Write-Host })` |\n| 🔴 **db** | Pool esgotado: 500 no payment, 502 no checkout | `(1..10).ForEach({ curl.exe -s -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=db\"; Write-Host })` |\n| 🟣 **cpu** | Antifraude (0.5–1s); acima de 0.8s dá 500 | `(1..10).ForEach({ curl.exe -s -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/checkout?scenario=cpu\"; Write-Host })` |\n\n### Gerador de carga\n| Quando | Comando |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Deixar o gráfico vermelho (toda chamada falha) | `docker compose stop load-generator` e depois `docker compose run -d --no-deps --name loadgen-erros -e LOADGEN_SCENARIO=db load-generator` |\n| Mistura contínua (fast, io, db e cpu) | igual ao de cima, trocando `db` por `mix` no `-e` |\n| Voltar ao tráfego saudável | `docker stop loadgen-erros` depois `docker rm loadgen-erros` depois `docker start observabilidade-1-load-generator-1` |"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1 · Sintoma — o serviço está saudável? (RED, janela de 1 minuto)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de requisições",
      "description": "Requisições por segundo no payment, no último minuto. O R do RED.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 2 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Erro no payment (5xx)",
      "description": "Percentual de respostas 5xx do payment no último minuto. O E do RED.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 2 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "502 no checkout (cascata)",
      "description": "Quanto da falha do payment chegou ao cliente como 502 Bad Gateway.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 2 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=\"502\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latência P50",
      "description": "Metade das requisições termina abaixo deste tempo. É a experiência típica.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 2 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latência P95",
      "description": "95% das requisições terminam abaixo deste tempo. O D do RED.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 2 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latência P99",
      "description": "A cauda: o 1% mais lento. Costuma subir antes do P95 quando poucas requisições ficam lentas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 2 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sucesso x Falha no checkout (requisições por minuto)",
      "description": "O que o cliente recebeu. Verde = HTTP 200. Vermelho = HTTP 502, quando o payment falhou.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" },
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 1
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Sucesso" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Falha" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=~\"2..\"}[1m])) or on() vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Sucesso"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or on() vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Falha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Erro por serviço — a falha se propaga",
      "description": "O payment devolve 500 e o checkout repassa como 502. As duas linhas sobem juntas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "payment (500)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "checkout (502)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "payment (500)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/checkout\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "checkout (502)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência P50 / P95 / P99 — clique num losango ◆ para abrir a requisição no Tempo",
      "description": "As linhas são percentis. Cada losango é uma requisição real, na altura da sua própria duração; o clique abre o trace dela.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "P50" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "P95" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "P99" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "D" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "#8e8e8e", "mode": "fixed" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1 },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [6, 6] } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\",scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P99"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=\"payment\",span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\",payment_scenario=~\"$scenario\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "Requisições reais ◆ (P95 calculado pelo Tempo)",
          "exemplar": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2 · Isolamento — qual cenário e qual requisição? (comparação dos últimos 5 minutos)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "panels": []
    },
